        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The lash of this <em>+2 greater striking extending whip</em> appears impossibly tangled, but it uncoils automatically whenever you use it.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Winding Labyrinth</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate, illusion, mental, visual)</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> If your next action is to make a Strike with the whip or activate its extending rune, a target hit by the whip experiences the sense of being lost in circuitous Darklands caverns. The target must attempt a @Check[will|dc:34|options:inflicts:slowed] save. If you critically hit, the result of the target's Will save is treated as one degree of success worse.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and becomes temporarily immune to Winding Labyrinth for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature treats all squares as difficult terrain until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} for 1 round as it gets its bearings.</p>"
        },
